scene: preserve precise positions until physical output rendering

Keep the existing integer scene ABI for hit-testing and protocol-facing
geometry, but allow compositor-owned nodes to retain a double-precision
logical origin. Destination edges are rounded only after applying the output
scale, preventing fractional animation coordinates from being filtered
between physical pixels.

Precise positions live in a node addon, so this remains ABI-compatible with
zig-wlroots and existing wlroots scene users.

